rkers aged ≥16 years\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Fatality rates were calculated as highway transportation deaths occurring within a state, using employment data within the state from CPS for the 6-year period.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}